<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> w}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans\">PredTrans</a> <span class=\"fn\">Pred</span> <span class=\"fn\">EPosts</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">post</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">Pred</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">eposts</span> : <span class=\"fn\">EPosts</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">Pred</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Apply the predicate transformer to a postcondition and exception postcondition.","docLink":"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.apply","kind":"def","line":50,"name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.apply","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.lean#L50-L53"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Order</span>.<span class=\"name\">PredTrans</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">Pred</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">EPosts</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder\">PartialOrder</a> <span class=\"fn\">Pred</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder\">PartialOrder</a> <span class=\"fn\">EPosts</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> w)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> (max (max u v) w)</div></div>","info":{"doc":"`PredTrans Pred EPosts α` is the type of monotone predicate transformers with result type `α`,\nover an ordered type `Pred` of assertions and an ordered type `EPosts` of exception\npostconditions. `PredTrans.apply : PredTrans Pred EPosts α → (α → Pred) → EPosts → Pred` runs the\npredicate transformer, and `PredTrans.apply_mono` proves that it is monotone in both ordered\narguments. `PredTrans.mk` constructs predicate transformers. The definition of `PredTrans.apply`\nis opaque, for the efficiency of kernel reduction.","docLink":"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans","kind":"structure","line":31,"name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.lean#L31-L42"}}],"imports":["Std.Internal.Order.Basic"],"instances":[{"className":"Lean.Order.PartialOrder","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instPartialOrder","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"Lean.Order.CCPO","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instCCPO","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"Monad","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonad","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"LawfulMonad","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instLawfulMonad","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"MonadLift","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadLiftForall","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans","Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"MonadExceptOf","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadExceptOfProdForall","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.IsMonotoneTryCatch","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instIsMonotoneTryCatchProdForall","typeNames":["Prod"]},{"className":"MonadExceptOf","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadExceptOfProdForallOfIsMonotoneTryCatch","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.IsMonotoneTryCatch","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instIsMonotoneTryCatchProdForall_1","typeNames":["Prod"]},{"className":"MonadStateOf","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadStateOfForall","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"MonadReaderOf","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadReaderOfForall","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"MonadExceptOf","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instMonadExceptOfForall","typeNames":["Lean.Order.PredTrans"]},{"className":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.IsMonotoneTryCatch","name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.instIsMonotoneTryCatchForall","typeNames":[]}],"name":"Std.Internal.Order.PredTrans"}